{"watch":23,"start":6600,"events":[{"seq":1063,"t":6600,"type":"watch","watch":23},{"seq":1064,"t":6600,"type":"decode","house":"rhino","letter":"L279","text":"F_RST FOOT, _O_D _T __ST FORD.","readable":false},{"seq":1065,"t":6600,"type":"decode","house":"rhino","letter":"L360","text":"HO___, ____H _O _O__H ____ ____.","readable":false},{"seq":1066,"t":6600,"type":"decode","house":"kite","letter":"L363","text":"__E_E _O _O__ _O__E_ ___E__ _O _O_E ___E_ _O_____ _1?","readable":false},{"seq":1067,"t":6600,"type":"decode","house":"tiger","letter":"L241","text":"BO_MEN, HOLD AT SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","readable":true},{"seq":1068,"t":6600,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1942,"retries":0},{"seq":1069,"t":6600,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"It is Watch 23. Doctrine is to hold F1/F2 with inf/ele and have cav hunt riders. Rhino inf/ele are at F1/F2 (1w/3w ago). Kite has units near F1/F2 (1w/3w ago). Orchid has units at F1/F2 (1w/11w ago). I should reinforce F1/F2 and use cavalry to screen/attack enemy riders. The capt"},{"seq":1070,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c361","house":"rhino","letter":"L442","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":6900,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"RANKJS BKKT, DKHS MT JKQTD OMJG IESSHA."},{"seq":1071,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c362","house":"rhino","letter":"L443","kind":"order","to":"rhino-ele-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1"],"depart":6900,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, HOLD AT NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"AHALDMJTR, DKHS MT JKQTD OMJG WART."},{"seq":1072,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c363","house":"rhino","letter":"L444","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":6600,"plain":"HORSE, SCOUT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":1073,"t":6600,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1802,"retries":0},{"seq":1074,"t":6600,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 23. Doctrine: Offer rhino truce, then betray it at the last watch. I should send a truce offer to rhino now. Kite inf-1/2 are near F1/F2. Rhino has forces at F1/F2. I will try to initiate the truce."},{"seq":1075,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c364","house":"kite","letter":"L445","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":6900,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, DKHO TS JKQSD ATJG WNRS."},{"seq":1076,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c365","house":"kite","letter":"L446","kind":"letter","to":"rhino-camp","path":["kite-camp","north-village","rhino-camp"],"depart":6600,"plain":"TRUCE","cipher":null},{"seq":1077,"t":6600,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1850,"retries":0},{"seq":1078,"t":6600,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino and Kite pressure F1 (West Ford). Rhino has units near F1 and F2, and a large force at F1. My infantry/cav are at F1/DHARA VILLAGE. I should reinforce F1 and perhaps probe F2. Rhino's orders suggest they are concentrating at F1/West Ford. I will reinforce F1 and use cavalry"},{"seq":1079,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c366","house":"orchid","letter":"L447","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":6600,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1080,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c367","house":"orchid","letter":"L448","kind":"order","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west"],"depart":6600,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":1081,"t":6600,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1668,"retries":0},{"seq":1082,"t":6600,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"It is Watch 23. My doctrine is to take the east ford (F3) with everything in the first 5 watches. I have troops at F3 (tiger-inf-1, 2, tiger-arch-1). Kite has cav at F3 (5w ago). I must reinforce F3 immediately. Orchid has captured letters suggesting movement near S-West/S